From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Agent <claude-agent@invalid>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:46:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] windows.devices.display: Validate native chromaticities and
 DisplayID filler.

Expose native RGBW only when every point lies in the chromaticity domain,
convert CIE 1976 u'v' declarations to CIE 1931 xy instead of leaving them
unavailable, and leave the declaration unavailable when the not-understood
feature bit 5 is set, matching the library contract. Accept zero filler
after the last DisplayID data block and reject a section whose filler is
non-zero. Correct copied file descriptions.

winex11.drv: Never free an EDID buffer XRRGetOutputProperty did not
return, and do not warn for outputs that simply have no EDID property.

windows.devices.display/tests: Include devguid.h before initguid.h so the
test links against libuuid's GUID definitions instead of duplicating them,
and cover chromaticity validity, CIE 1976 conversion, feature bit 5 and
DisplayID filler handling.
